  source_ref = 'StotraNidhi Sri Siddhi Vinayaka Vrata Kalpam (Telugu), round-trip verified Telugu->Devanagari by scripts/build-upachara-mantras.mjs. Replaces the one-line placeholder this step carried from the original app, which cited no text at all.',
